      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_text.py` that generates an embedding vector for a text string using an external provider, I will choose Amazon Bedrock as the concrete external provider. I will import the necessary module from the Amazon Bedrock SDK and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
